---
// BentoGallery.astro - Vida en Aneley: Bento Grid con talleres, huerto, arte y comunidad
---

<section id="galeria" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-aneley-cream relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-aneley-green-soft text-aneley-green font-heading font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-aneley-green/20"
      >
        🎨 Cotidianeidad y Alegría
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-aneley-purple leading-tight tracking-tight mb-4"
      >
        Vida en Aneley
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-body text-base sm:text-lg text-aneley-text-muted leading-relaxed"
      >
        Un recorrido visual por los talleres, el huerto y los momentos mágicos
        donde nuestros niños y niñas construyen recuerdos para toda la vida.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Container -->
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 auto-rows-[260px] sm:auto-rows-[280px]"
    >
      <!-- Bento Item 1: Huerto & Naturaleza (Large: span 2 cols, span 2 rows) -->
      <div
        class="md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group shadow-card border-2 border-white/80"
      >
        <img
          src="https://plus.unsplash.com/premium_photo-1664303650962-19ce73494d7c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
          alt="Niños trabajando la tierra y cuidando el huerto escolar en Limache"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-aneley-purple-deep/85 via-black/30 to-transparent"
        >
        </div>

        <!-- Top Badge -->
        <div class="absolute top-5 left-5">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-aneley-green text-white text-sm font-heading font-bold shadow-sm"
          >
            <span>🌱</span> Huerto & Permacultura
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Content -->
        <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white">
          <h3
            class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white mb-2 leading-tight"
          >
            La Tierra como Maestra Viva
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-sm sm:text-smm text-white/90 leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-lg mb-3"
          >
            Aprender de ciclos biológicos, compostaje, biodiversidad y el
            respeto por cada ser vivo. Los niños cosechan lo que ellos mismos
            sembraron con amor.
          </p>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-aneley-yellow font-semibold"
          >
            <span>🌾 Cultivos de temporada</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>💧 Cuidado consciente del agua</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 2: Taller de Pintura y Cerámica (span 1 col, span 2 rows on desktop) -->
      <div
        class="md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 md:row-span-2 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group shadow-card border-2 border-white/80"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513364776144-60967b0f800f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
          alt="Manos con pintura y creación libre en taller de arte"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-aneley-pink/90 via-black/20 to-transparent"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="absolute top-5 left-5">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-aneley-pink text-white text-sm font-heading font-bold shadow-sm"
          >
            <span>🎨</span> Arte Sin Pautas Rígidas
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-xl text-white mb-2">
            Expresión Libre
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            Acuarela, barro, tintes naturales extraídos de flores y hojas de
            Limache. El arte como canal de descarga y autoconocimiento.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 3: Música, Ritmos & Sonido (span 1 col, span 1 row) -->
      <div
        class="md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 md:row-span-1 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group shadow-card border-2 border-white/80"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511671782779-c97d3d27a1d4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
          alt="Instrumentos musicales y cantos en ronda"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-aneley-yellow/90 via-black/30 to-transparent"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-aneley-yellow text-aneley-text text-sm font-heading font-bold"
          >
            <span>🎶</span> Música & Ritmo
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white">
            Sonoterapia & Danza
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/95">
            Tambores, cuencos y cantos en asamblea.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 4: Literatura & Asambleas en Ronda (span 1 col, span 1 row) -->
      <div
        class="md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 md:row-span-1 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group shadow-card border-2 border-white/80"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1456513080510-7bf3a84b82f8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
          alt="Libros infantiles y rincón de cuentacuentos"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-aneley-purple/90 via-black/30 to-transparent"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-aneley-purple text-white text-sm font-heading font-bold"
          >
            <span>📖</span> Rincón Literario
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white">
            Cuentacuentos
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/95">
            Historias bajo los árboles y amor por los libros.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 5: Cocina Consciente & Vida Comunitaria (span 2 cols or 4 cols) -->
      <div
        class="md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 md:row-span-1 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group shadow-card border-2 border-white/80"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543269865-cbf427effbad?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
          alt="Comunidad de familias y niños compartiendo comida y crianza"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-aneley-purple-deep/85 via-black/30 to-transparent"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white text-aneley-purple text-sm font-heading font-bold shadow-sm"
          >
            <span>🍲</span> Cocina & Co-Crianza
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-5 right-5 text-white">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white mb-1">
            Alimentación Saludable & Encuentros Familiares
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/90">
            Amasado de pan integral, ensaladas de la huerta y mingas
            comunitarias de fin de semana.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 6: Ciencia & Exploración Científica (span 2 cols) -->
      <div
        class="md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 md:row-span-1 relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden group shadow-card border-2 border-white/80"
      >
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516627145497-ae6968895b74?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
          alt="Niños explorando la naturaleza con lupas y microscopios de campo"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-aneley-sky/90 via-black/30 to-transparent"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-aneley-sky text-white text-sm font-heading font-bold shadow-sm"
          >
            <span>🔬</span> Ciencia en Vivo
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-5 right-5 text-white">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-white mb-1">
            Pequeños Científicos del Valle
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/90">
            Lupas, colecciones de insectos, experimentos de física elemental y
            meteorología local.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Instagram Banner Callout -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/aneley_escuela_libreyfeliz/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white text-aneley-purple hover:bg-aneley-purple-soft font-heading font-bold text-smm shadow-soft border border-aneley-purple/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-5 h-5 text-aneley-pink"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        >
          <path
            d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        <span
          >Síguenos en Instagram @aneley_escuela_libreyfeliz para ver nuestras
          actividades diarias</span
        >
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
